### Base configuration
### Default app port: 8081, base context-path: /api

### Health check (Actuator)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/actuator/health

### Users
### Create user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "richard@testmail.com",
  "fullName": "Richard"
}

### List users
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users

### Notes
### Create note (publishes NoteCreatedEvent)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First",
  "content": "Hello Modulith",
  "userId": 1
}

### List notes
GET http://localhost:8081/api/notes

### Get note by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/notes/1

### Update note
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated",
  "content": "Updated content"
}

### Delete note
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/notes/1

